{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Apocalypse Factory</i> is an <strong>automation and factory-building game</strong> set in a <strong>post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies</strong>.<br>You\u2019re one of the few survivors sent to the surface to <strong>mine, craft, and build production lines</strong> that supply vital resources needed to <strong>construct your ultimate Escape Ark</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build complex automated factories, power them with electricity, and deliver everything your Escape Ark requires \u2014 all while <strong>defending your machines from constant zombie threats</strong> above ground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and automate complex <strong>production lines</strong> to craft essential items and resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and expand across a <strong>large, dangerous map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine dozens of resources</strong> and process them into advanced materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a wide variety of <strong>machines, structures, and power systems</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up <strong>electrical networks</strong> using wind power and other generators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your factories</strong> against relentless zombie hordes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research <strong>technologies</strong> to unlock new automation and defense tools</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Early Access Approach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Apocalypse Factory</i> is already fully playable, but I want to refine it together with the community.<br>Player feedback will help improve <strong>balance, automation flow, and overall polish</strong>.<br>The game will continue to grow through <strong>small updates and quality-of-life improvements</strong> before its full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re interested in playtesting or sharing feedback, join the <strong>Discord Server</strong> and help shape the future of <i>Apocalypse Factory</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091150/extras/0c839b331bbdef26d4509f34d7714cb4.poster.avif?t=1769549768\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091150/extras/0c839b331bbdef26d4509f34d7714cb4.webm?t=1769549768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091150/extras/0c839b331bbdef26d4509f34d7714cb4.mp4?t=1769549768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2091150?t=1769549768","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2091150?t=1769549768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769549768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769549768","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Apocalypse Factory</i> is an <strong>automation and factory-building game</strong> set in a <strong>post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies</strong>.<br>You\u2019re one of the few survivors sent to the surface to <strong>mine, craft, and build production lines</strong> that supply vital resources needed to <strong>construct your ultimate Escape Ark</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build complex automated factories, power them with electricity, and deliver everything your Escape Ark requires \u2014 all while <strong>defending your machines from constant zombie threats</strong> above ground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and automate complex <strong>production lines</strong> to craft essential items and resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and expand across a <strong>large, dangerous map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine dozens of resources</strong> and process them into advanced materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a wide variety of <strong>machines, structures, and power systems</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up <strong>electrical networks</strong> using wind power and other generators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your factories</strong> against relentless zombie hordes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research <strong>technologies</strong> to unlock new automation and defense tools</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Early Access Approach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Apocalypse Factory</i> is already fully playable, but I want to refine it together with the community.<br>Player feedback will help improve <strong>balance, automation flow, and overall polish</strong>.<br>The game will continue to grow through <strong>small updates and quality-of-life improvements</strong> before its full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re interested in playtesting or sharing feedback, join the <strong>Discord Server</strong> and help shape the future of <i>Apocalypse Factory</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img